---
// The Artificial Intelligence chapter of the home page: how I work with AI, then the three projects as evidence.
import '../styles/chapter.css';

const bot = '/work/ai-trading-bot/';
---
<section class="ch" id="ai" aria-labelledby="ai-t">
  <div class="open">
    <p class="meta kick">Artificial Intelligence</p>
    <h2 id="ai-t">AI brings speed. <em>We bring judgement.</em></h2>
    <svg class="sig" data-sig="ai" viewBox="0 0 320 200" aria-hidden="true"></svg>
    <p class="ch-lede">Three AI projects, each turning a flood of data into one clear answer.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="row4"><ul class="rules">
    <li class="rule">
      <h3>I choose the tools. The AI builds.</h3>
      <p>In the trading bot, I picked the broker and the AI models that read the news. Claude wrote the code and the tests.</p>
      <a href={`${bot}#who`}>Who did what</a>
    </li>
    <li class="rule">
      <h3>The bar is set before the results.</h3>
      <p>The pass marks were written down before the first test. No idea reached them, and the page says so.</p>
      <a href={`${bot}#research`}>The research</a>
    </li>
    <li class="rule">
      <h3>Results are checked twice.</h3>
      <p>A second AI agent redid the bot's calculations on its own. The Bitcoin figures were rebuilt from raw prices.</p>
      <a href={`${bot}bitcoin-study/`}>The Bitcoin study</a>
    </li>
    <li class="rule">
      <h3>What fails stays on the page.</h3>
      <p>Every case study ends with its limits, down to a leaked API key that had to be revoked.</p>
      <a href={`${bot}#limits`}>The trading bot's limits</a>
    </li>
  </ul></div>

  <div class="ev">
    <p class="meta">The evidence</p>
    <a class="proj" href={bot}>
      <p class="meta st live">Live on paper trading</p>
      <div><h3>AI Trading Bot</h3><p class="hl">AI builds a trading bot in minutes. The hard part is tuning it to behave the way I would.</p></div>
      <p class="fact">Three bots trade US stocks on paper. The question: does AI reading the news beat a simple list of words?<span class="go">Read the case study</span></p>
    </a>
    <div class="proj" id="cfo">
      <p class="meta st idle">Working pipeline · product not built</p>
      <div><h3>Personal CFO</h3><p class="hl">My whole financial situation, live: where the money goes, what changed and what comes next.</p></div>
      <p class="fact">Built from about 2,400 real transactions. Every number traces back to one of them.<span>Case study to follow</span></p>
    </div>
    <div class="proj" id="radar">
      <p class="meta st idle">In alpha · first alerts not sent yet</p>
      <div><h3>Property Deal Radar</h3><p class="hl">Brings together the property investments with the best economic viability, and alerts me when a hot deal appears.</p></div>
      <p class="fact">Built for my own investments, and the kind of tool an estate agent would want. It may become a product.<span>Case study to follow</span></p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="close"></div>
</section>

